# Shell scripts + the init banner run on Linux — always store and check out LF.
*.sh text eol=lf
.github/assets/banner-raw.txt text eol=lf

# Everything under rootfs/ ships into the Linux image: extensionless s6 service
# scripts (run), envsubst templates (*.tmpl) and configs. No binaries live here
# (checked) — pin the whole tree to LF so CRLF checkouts can't break shebangs.
rootfs/** text eol=lf

# Workflow files are executed by the Actions runner: a CRLF run: block breaks
# the shell mid-line. Same pin as in the sibling repos.
.github/workflows/*.yml text eol=lf

# Generated banner assets: the generator writes LF, and their blobs still held
# CRLF, so every run reported them as modified while the bytes were identical.
# Pinned rather than blanket-normalised, to keep this file's narrow scope.
.github/assets/*.svg text eol=lf
